    <mxCell id="t_title" value="SmartWaste Secure — Trust Boundaries" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#17365D;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
  <mxGeometry x="40" y="25" width="900" height="40" as="geometry"/>
</mxCell><mxCell id="t_sub" value="Security zones and controls at transitions from less-trusted to more-trusted environments" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#475569;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
  <mxGeometry x="40" y="65" width="1000" height="25" as="geometry"/>
</mxCell><mxCell id="tb1" value="TB-1  •  IOT / UNTRUSTED DEVICE NETWORK

Smart bins • sensor firmware • MQTT client • device credentials

Primary threats: device spoofing • telemetry tampering • flooding" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#64748B;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 6;fontColor=#334155;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=12;spacingLeft=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
  <mxGeometry x="55" y="130" width="1040" height="170" as="geometry"/>
</mxCell><mxCell id="tb2" value="TB-2  •  APPLICATION / API NETWORK

API Gateway • Flask services • Web UI • Authentication / RBAC

Primary threats: credential abuse • broken authorization • API abuse" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#64748B;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 6;fontColor=#334155;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=12;spacingLeft=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
  <mxGeometry x="55" y="335" width="1040" height="170" as="geometry"/>
</mxCell><mxCell id="tb3" value="TB-3  •  PROTECTED DATA LAYER

PostgreSQL • audit records • route data • secrets/configuration

Primary threats: unauthorized reads/writes • secret exposure • data integrity loss" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#64748B;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 6;fontColor=#334155;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=12;spacingLeft=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
  <mxGeometry x="55" y="540" width="1040" height="170" as="geometry"/>
</mxCell><mxCell id="ctl1" value="CONTROLS
TLS • device authentication • schema/range validation • rate limiting" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF7E8;strokeColor=#B54708;fontColor=#7A2E0B;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
  <mxGeometry x="120" y="240" width="910" height="45" as="geometry"/>
</mxCell><mxCell id="ctl2" value="CONTROLS
TLS • JWT/RBAC • input validation • rate limiting • audit logging" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EAF2F8;strokeColor=#1F5A94;fontColor=#17365D;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
  <mxGeometry x="120" y="445" width="910" height="45" as="geometry"/>
</mxCell><mxCell id="ctl3" value="CONTROLS
